Package: latentcov.sbm
Title: Latent Covariance Between Latent Block in SBM
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Louis", "Lacoste", , "louis.lacoste@inrae.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package implements a latent covariance structure between the latent blocks of the Stochastic Block Model to relax the hypothesis of independance between the blocks.
